  "reasoning": "Turn 2 failed because the model generated only a text response without any tool calls, while the ground truth expected a `get_ticket` or equivalent tool invocation to retrieve ticket information. The evaluation flagged an empty tool-call list for that turn, causing the multi-turn workflow to break.",
