  "root_cause_analysis": "The model incorrectly assumed authentication was required before making the API call and deferred the tool invocation entirely. This violated the multi-turn state consistency principle: once a user requests ticket information, the model should attempt the tool call immediately rather than blocking on credentials that may already be available in the system context.",
